icate prevention\n- I cannot show audit logs\n- I cannot demonstrate training/enforcement mechanisms\n- I don't have access to case studies\n\nI need to be honest: the CRM system I have access to is a database management tool, not a comprehensive sales enablement platform with training and enforcement features.\n\nWould you like me to:\n1. Continue working within the capabilities of this CRM system (managing records, tracking relationships, creating tasks/opportunities)?\n2. Or would you prefer to explore other options that might better meet your needs?\n\nI want to be transparent about what this system can and cannot do.",
